{"id":"junto","lemma":"junto","pos":"prep","rank":241,"glosses":["next to, together with, alongside","along with, together with, alongside","in conjunction with"],"ipa":"/ˈxunto/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/ee/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-junto.wav","examples":[{"text":"Llegó junto conmigo.","en":"He arrived with me.","words":[{"g":"to arrive, get","l":"llegar"},null,{"g":"with me"}]},{"text":"Él vive junto a mi casa.","en":"He lives next to me.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/527130","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to applaud","l":"vivar"},null,{"g":"to"},{"g":"my"},{"g":"house"}]},{"text":"El hospital queda junto al colegio.","en":"The hospital is next to the school.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"hospital"},{"g":"curfew"},null,{"g":"to the"},{"g":"school"}]},{"text":"Siéntate junto a mí.","en":"Sit beside me.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/501141","words":[{"g":"to seat","l":"sentar"},null,{"g":"to"},{"g":"me"}]},{"text":"Su casa está junto a un río.","en":"His house is by a river.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/459201","words":[{"g":"his / her / your"},{"g":"house"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},null,{"g":"to"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"river"}]}]}